      "evidence_id": "evidence-hhl-depth-overhead--1025a91f0184",
      "title": "HHL Depth Overhead Estimate",
      "excerpt": "Despite potential exponential speedups, the review reports that circuit size and depth overhead can balloon to about 10^25 in one proposed realization of HHL without major optimization.",
      "overview": "The overhead estimate gives a concrete scale for the gap between asymptotic complexity and implementable quantum machine learning. It supports a conservative reading: better algorithms and cost models are prerequisites for useful alternatives to classical methods.",
