      "title": "Four Practical Caveats",
      "excerpt": "The review names four fundamental problems for future work: input problem, output problem, costing problem, and benchmarking problem.",
      "overview": "This list provides the review's practical interpretation of the field. It organizes the limits on quantum machine learning into data-loading costs, readout costs, actual gate counts, and evidence of advantage over modern classical heuristics.",
